[I] An Atari ST/STE/TT/Falcon emulator

[T] Hatari is an Atari ST/STE/TT/Falcon emulator. It tries to emulate the
[T] hardware as close as possible so that it is able to run most Atari
[T] programs, games and demos. It includes a cycle-exact 68000 CPU core,
[T] DSP56001 emulation for the Falcon, a built-in debugger and supports
[T] floppy, hard disk and GEMDOS directory emulation.

[U] https://www.hatari-emu.org/

[A] Thomas Huth and the Hatari developers
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/emulator
